      <div type="layout" source="#source-639-665" style="padding-inline-end: 0em; text-align: right">
        <p source="#source-657-665"><seg source="#source-657-665">舌代</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-665-919"><seg source="#source-665-896">一、大極丸の水夫、人を殺し候由。此事ハ西郷より申来リ候ニ付、小弟宜しく引合致し置候。此度毛利、望月が下坂致し候ニ付、諸事頼置候。何のわけも無事なるべしと奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-896-908">レ</note><seg source="#source-908-919">存候。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-919-1088"><seg source="#source-919-1045">一、昨日ハ御書拝見又別紙ニも大坂の町ぶれなど――より送りくれ候ニ付、其御地の御もよふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1045-1066"><rb>能</rb><rt>（よく）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1066-1088">わかり申候。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-1088-1522"><seg source="#source-1088-1160">一、大極丸此頃荷物積込などもすみ候よし。然レバ彼</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1166-1223"><seg source="#source-1160-1166">西村</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1190-1208">（大坂役人）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1223-1241">源吉方へ頼置</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1250-1304"><seg source="#source-1241-1250">フラフ</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1277-1289">（旗カ）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1304-1316">御受取被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1316-1328">レ</note><seg source="#source-1328-1343">成、御引替</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1343-1406"><rb><seg source="#source-1346-1349">可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1349-1361">レ</note><seg source="#source-1361-1364">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1364-1376">レ</note><seg source="#source-1376-1379">成</seg></rb><rt>（なさるべく）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1406-1484">候。此儀ハ別紙松井周助兄まで送り申候間、御そふだん可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1484-1496">レ</note><seg source="#source-1496-1499">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1499-1511">レ</note><seg source="#source-1511-1522">下候。</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1522-1578" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-1543-1578"><seg source="#source-1543-1552">廿五日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1552-1578" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1570-1578">龍馬</seg></seg></p>
